  "notes": [
    {
      "lead": "Four kinds of slip",
      "body": "Letters in the wrong order (<em>treize</em>, <em>quatre</em>), a missing accent (<em>très</em>, <em>ça va</em>), a missing hyphen (<em>dix-huit</em>), and words in the wrong order (<em>Quel âge as-tu ?</em>). Knowing which kind you are looking for makes it far easier to catch."
